# Local-only: agent notes, unsafe reference, and tool runtime
reference material-NOT LICENSE SAFE DONT COPY-grok bot/
AGENTS.md
.opencode/node_modules/
.opencode/goals/
.opencode/package-lock.json
.opencode/package.json
opencode.json

# Local launch logs and ad-hoc skill seeds
.scratch/*.log
.scratch/matt-skills-seed/

# Testing/process artifacts — live-test evidence, boot/teardown logs, probes,
# kill-timer records, driver scripts and their outputs. May contain private dsh
# session content; NEVER commit (operator rule 2026-09-20). Evidence lives in the
# repo from now on, never in new Desktop folders.
.scratch/testing/
# Ad-hoc research/process material: overnight notes, ADR drafts, repo analysis.
# Working files, never deliverables — the rulings live in docs/adr and tickets.
.scratch/_overnight-*/
.scratch/adr-drafts/
.scratch/repo-analysis/
# Release-prep report and its activation run logs — raw run output carries local
# home paths and dsh session ids; NEVER commit.
.scratch/release-prep/
# Runtime racoons ledger store (dev/cordis.racoons.patch.yml pins this root for
# isolated testing; the plugin default is <DSH_HOME>/storages/racoons, outside
# the repo). Holds live session ledgers and blobs — private dsh session content;
# NEVER commit (ticket 156).
.scratch/racoons-storage/
# Team-leader dispatch ledger (the skill says delete it when the job ends).
.team-leader-ledger.md

# Build and dependencies
node_modules/
lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Client bundle build output (npm run build:client)
/client/

# Stray worktrees / scratch clones a lane leaves behind while testing a fix.
# Each carries its own .git and would otherwise be committed as an embedded repo.
/cur/
/fixA/
/regress/

# Throwaway live-check homes (contain credentials and session data) - NEVER commit.
.scratch/night/live/

# Quarantine for stray artifacts swept out of the tree (e.g. badly expanded env paths).
# Junk binaries, never deliverables - NEVER commit.
.scratch/quarantine/

# Secret material is never committed: a credentials file leaked this way before.
.env
.env.*
credentials.json
credentials*.yml
*.pem
*.key

# Throwaway probe/test homes hold credentials and session data - NEVER commit.
.scratch/**/home
